[8516]={"The special Púkel-man statue can be found in the Drúadan Forest, north-west of Drû Bhûta.\
\
You should repair the special Púkel-men statue.","Ghân-buri-Ghân can be found in Drû Bhûta.\
\
You should bring the rocks to Ghân-buri-Ghân.","Mender of the Grey Wood","'Good good, first step you done. Now you have the permission of Drúedain to rebuild Okwô-kuryô that I tell you where it is in forest. Go rebuild Okwô-kuryô. It will then look over you.'","Bring the rocks to Ghân-buri-Ghân","Repair the Púkel-man statue","You have repaired the Púkel-man statue.","Gathered rocks (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'${PLAYER}, I make you Drúadan in name if you like. All you do is perform rite of passage. First bring me rocks from old Men quarry.'","You look at the Púkel-man statue and realize that it is a sign of true friendship between you and the Drúedain. As you look away from the statue, you thought you saw the Púkel-man statue move slightly. Again, you look back but it remains motionless. Perhaps you just need some rest after this long adventure.","Completado","Nardol Quarry is located in south-western Taur Drúadan.\
\
You should gather rocks from Nardol Quarry.","Ghân-buri-Ghân, chieftain of the Wose, considers you an equal to the Drúedain now. He has one last task for you though.","Gather rocks from Nardol Quarry (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8517]={"'You have done well, these plants will work perfectly. I am ashamed for not having saved the noble Pendulf, but with this full set of reagents I vow not to fail Thane Mildrith again.\
\
'I owe you much thanks.'","The plants desired by Elfwyn can be found growing in the Norcrofts in the areas outside the town of Elthengels.\
\
Elfwyn has asked you to collect various plantlife, so that he may use them to treat any serious wounds that may occur to people in Elthengels.","Collected Lamb's Ear (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected Meadow-maid (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect Meadow-maid (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collect Lamb's Ear (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Elfwyn with the herbs","The healer of Elthengels, Elfwyn, is distraught over the death of young Pendulf, Thane Mildrith's son. He feels his supplies are inadequate and is in need of a variety of local herbs in preparation for treating future wounds and injuries.","Collected Clotbur (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I am in a dire situation, friend. I am responsible for treating the wounds and injuries of the people of Elthengels, but I am without the necessary reagents to do so. Will you stay a moment and hear me out?\
\
'We cannot allow others to suffer the same fate as poor Pendulf, but I am unprepared! I have but a meagre supply of common herbs in my possession. If you were to gather some of the herbs and reagents I am in need of, I might be able to redeem myself by saving others.\
\
'Meadow-maid, Lamb's Ear, and Clotbur can all be found growing outside of Elthengels. These plants are most helpful in treating wounds, but I am currently lacking in their supply. Will you secure them to help bolster my reserves?'","Mending Wounds","Collect Clotbur (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Elfwyn, the healer, may be found at his home in Elthengels.\
\
Elfwyn is awaiting your return with the various plants he has asked you to collect."},
[8519]={"'Fetch me a tub of water from the fishing dock. I will need it to quench the iron.'","You have brought Aranbir the sack of coal for which he asked. You should talk to him to learn of your next task.","'Oh, hoi! What is this, Aranbir sent you to get him some lunch? Ah yes, a man cannot work on an empty stomach!'\
\
Endunâm puts together a plate of food and hands it to you.\
\
'There you are. No nibbling! Buy your own if you are hungry.'","You have gotten lunch from Endunâm. You should bring it to Aranbir.","'I need more coal to stoke the fire. Bring me coal from the stockpile on the crafter's wharf, near the oven.'","'Thank you for the water. It looks like hardly any of it was spilt. Impressive. The last task I have for you is the most important. Go to Endunâm and pick up my lunch. I am less productive when I am hungry.'","Aranbir has sent you on one last errand for him - to pick up his lunch. You should talk to Endunâm the cook on the crafter's wharf in Iridír.","Talk to Aranbir","Bring Aranbir his lunch","Talk to Endunâm","'Go to Endunâm and pick up my lunch.'","Aranbir has asked you to go to the fishing dock in Iridír, find a tub of water, and return with it in hand.","Bring a tub of water to Aranbir","You have brought Aranbir the tub of water for which he asked. You should talk to him to learn of your next task.","Aranbir has asked you to go to the crafter's wharf in Iridír and bring him a sack of coal that can be found near the oven.","Mending the Wheel","'Lunch! The highlight of my day. Other than breakfast and supper, anyway. Thank you so much for helping me today. While you were gone I repaired your wheel. It is sitting just there by the hut. Help yourself.'","The wheelwright, Aranbir, says he will make time to fix Khâmi's wheel if you fill in for his absent apprentice.","'Very good. Thank you for the coal. Next, I need more water for quenching the iron. You should be able to get a tub of water from the fishing dock.'","'Getting to this wheel should not be difficult if I have meaningful help. The first thing I need is more coal to stoke the fire. There is a stockpile of coal on the crafter's wharf near the cooks' oven. Go there and bring a sack of coal to me.'","Collect a sack of coal and bring it to Aranbir"},
[8522]={"'You are preparing an auction? Yes, I am interested. I am in need of cattle, for I sold my last ones to the war-effort. I made a decent profit, but I fear I sold too many. The Warg-packs to the east devoured the few I had left.\
\
'I am willing to buy more, but not until I know my investment is safe and secure. If you were to head into the hills east of here, to the rock the Wargs call home, and thin their numbers, I will consider coming to the auction to buy cattle.'","Wargs can be found to the east of Avardin in the Starkmoor.\
\
You should go to Hound's Rest and defeat Wargs.","'I can tell from the stench upon you that you have been fighting Wargs, and given that you are standing here, I assume you were victorious. I will attend the auction.'","'The Wargs are not good for business. I will not attend while there are so many wandering the hills.'","Talk to Folant in Avardin","Folant is in Avardin in the central Starkmoor.\
\
Folant will be pleased to hear that the Warg-population has been thinned.","The Wargs to the east have devastated the local cattle population, and Folant seeks to rectify the Warg-problem before he will attend the auction.","Defeated Wargs at the Hound's Rest (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Merchants of Avardin -- Folant","Defeat Wargs at the Hound's Rest (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8524]={"Merodeadores de pantano derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ucornos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Has hecho un gran favor a estas pobres criaturas. Me temo que han sufrido durante demasiado tiempo. Solo espero que lo que hemos logrado hoy no haya sido un asesinato sin sentido. Gracias.'","De alguna manera, la esencia misma del Pantano Rojo ha sido corrompida. Radagast el Pardo, un mago que ha llegado a Agamaur, busca descubrir la causa.","Vence a los merodeadores de pantano (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Por favor, no me hagas repetirlo. Ya es bastante difícil pensar que debemos hacer daño a estos ucornos o a sus pastores.'","Radagast está en el campamento de los Eglain, al sur de Agamaur.\
\
Radagast, no sin dificultad, te ordenó destruir a los ucornos y a los acechadores del pantano de Agamaur, lo cual has hecho. Debes informar inmediatamente al Mago de tu éxito.","Un acto de misericordia","Vence a los ucornos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Has hecho un buen trabajo hasta ahora, ${PLAYER}. Estoy impresionado, y no me impresiono fácilmente por un simple ${RACE}. A menudo encuentro que los de tu clase carecen del sentido común que poseen mis pequeños amigos, pero tú has demostrado una mayor comprensión.\
\
'Tengo que pedirte algo que me horroriza. Es necesario destruir a los ucornos corrompidos y a sus pastores, los merodeadores de pantano. Siento que no hay esperanza de redención para estas pobres criaturas. Los ucornos y los merodeadores de pantano viven al noroeste.\
\
'Es una terrible tragedia, pero no veo otro camino que sea más misericordioso. También estoy muy preocupado, porque sea lo que sea esta corrupción, no fue obra de Ivar el Manosagrienta.'","Hay ucornos y merodeadores de pantano al noroeste de Agamaur.\
\
La corteza que le trajiste a Radagast reveló que la corrupción del pantano ha ido demasiado lejos y que no hay esperanza de recuperar Agamaur ni a sus criaturas. Radagast te ha encomendado la tarea de poner fin, por misericordia, a los ucornos y merodeadores de pantano que viven allí."},
[8525]={"'I know who you are. My son Bergil has told me about you! I've heard countless stories of your heroics throughout the city.'\
\
You tell Beregond that you appreciate his words and explain that you are here to give orders from Ormatar.\
\
'All in a day's work, I suppose. Is it true that you are a friend of Peregrin Took? He is a friend of mine as well!\
\
'You must come with me to Merethrond. You should see the grand feast-hall of Minas Tirith as it is truly a sight to behold. Also, I would very much like to hear all about your adventures with Peregrin Took! Meet me in Merethrond when you are ready.'","Enter Merethrond","The staff thanks you and wishes to see your style of fighting","Merethrond is located near the Citadel.\
\
You should seek out the feast-hall.","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. You make even a simple chore an adventure. No wonder you are also friends with Peregrin.\
\
'That was nice of you to teach the kitchen staff some basic fighting skills. It brought some joy to their tired faces. It saddens me to think that tomorrow they may have to put that knowledge to practical use on the battlefield.'","'Please let me hear a story, and then we shall get started with this task.'\
\
You recount a story about your time with Pippin in Rivendell.\
\
'What a fantastic tale! I wish Peregrin were here right now. I bet he'd have some bits to add. I do enjoy the way he tells stories. Well, enough from me, shall we complete this task?'","Bring the plates to the kitchen staff","The kitchen staff can be found on the lowest level of Merethrond.\
\
You should take the plates to the kitchen staff.","Collected empty plates (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Show how you defeat enemies (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'This feast-hall is quite spectacular, is it not?'","Beregond has been tasked with tidying up the feast-hall. He is glad to have your company as it will make this menial task more enjoyable, and give him some time to talk to you about your adventures.","'Thank you kindly for the plates. As you can see, there are not many of us down here. We appreciate any help.\
\
'If you have a moment, we were just discussing the best way to defeat those Easterlings we keep hearing about. You look like a skilled warrior. Perhaps you would be able to show us a move or two? We would love to learn how to take them on if they ever got into the kitchen.'\
\
You gladly accept to give them a demonstration of your combat skills.","Collect empty plates (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Speak with Beregond","The kitchen staff can be found in the lowest level of Merethrond.\
\
You should show off your style of fighting for the kitchen staff.","Beregond can be found in Merethrond, near the Citadel.\
\
You should speak to Beregond.","Merethrond","Merethrond can be found near the Citadel.\
\
You should collect empty plates to bring to the kitchen staff."},
[8526]={"'Si el Condestable Bolger no hace algo sobre los bandidos que siguen robando de mis campos, me veré obligado a quejarme ante la guardia en Bree por su incapacidad para ayudar a la buena gente de Entibo.'","'¿Tienes algo para mí?'","El Condestable Bolger vive al sureste de Entibo, en las afueras del pueblo.\
\
Himloc Grouse te ha pedido que lleves una carta al Condestable Bolger comunicando sus preocupaciones sobre los Montebruno.","Lleva la carta de Himloc al Condestable Bolger","'No sé cuántas cartas de Himloc puedo soportar. Será mejor que hagamos algo sobre los bandidos que están robando de su cultivo de hierba para pipa antes de que reciba otra.'","Himloc Grouse de Entibo está convencido de que los bandidos Montebruno han estado robando de su campo de hierba para pipa y quiere que el Condestable Bolger haga algo al respecto.","Mensaje para el Condestable","'He notado que mi campo de hierba para pipa está bastante menos robusto de lo que debería. Al principio sospeché que los animales habían entrado — hemos tenido algunos problemas con lobos acercándose demasiado al pueblo últimamente — pero no creo que esa sea la respuesta. ¿Qué tendrían que ver los lobos con la hierba para pipa?\
\
'¡Creo que los bandidos Montebruno son los culpables, ${PLAYER}! Los Hombres han tenido gusto por la hierba para pipa desde que les enseñamos el oficio, y ahora temo que estos villanos han estado colándose después del anochecer para robar parte de mi cultivo más prometedor.\
\
'Lleva esta carta al Condestable Bolger y pregúntale qué piensa hacer al respecto. Lo encontrarás al sureste de aquí, en las afueras de Entibo. Debe hacer algo. ¡Estos Hombres han ido demasiado lejos!'"},
[8527]={"'Veo que nuestro mensaje te llegó sin problemas. Es una buena señal. Debiste notar las miradas inquietas al pasar por el campamento. No es por miedo. Aunque eres alguien de fuera, muchos fueron avisados de tu llegada.\
\
'Esa inquietud viene más bien de la expectación bajo la que vivimos ahora. Angmar se agita en el norte, y somos casi incapaces de detener su avance. Hay mucho por hacer... si uno está dispuesto.\
\
'No tenemos mucho que ofrecer, pero no dejaremos de agradecer cualquier ayuda.'","Esteldín se halla en el corazón de las colinas, en la región oriental de las Quebradas del Norte conocida como Dehesa del Rey. Debes buscar allí al Montaraz llamado Daervunn.\
\
Encuentra a Daervunn en Esteldín y habla con él.","Habla con Daervunn en Esteldín","Mensaje de los Montaraces de Esteldín","En las zonas orientales de las Quebradas del Norte, oculto entre las colinas, yace el último vestigio de un pueblo noble que ha solicitado tu ayuda.","${CLASS},\
\
Saeradan, uno de los nuestros, nos ha dicho que has demostrado tu valía una y otra vez. Te estamos agradecidos por ello.\
\
Nos gustaría hablar contigo en nuestro hogar ancestral en Esteldín. Búscame allí.\
\
Con respeto,\
\
Daervunn"},
[8528]={"Find Athelbald","Found Athelbald","Talk to Athelbald","'These boars have been more aggressive lately.'","Message of Warning","You came to the Folde Farm to warn Witgil of the imminent Orc-attack.","'Athelbald went out to hunt for boar-meat some time ago and has yet to return. Would you go look for him in the woods to the east of the farm and see that he returns safely?'","'Orcs? I do not fear Orcs. I shall complete my task ere I return to the farm. The meat I collect is necessary to feed the people of Aldburg.'","Athelbald is hunting boar-meat in the woods to the east of the Folde Farm.\
\
Witgil asked you to find Athelbald and see to it that he returns safely to the Folde Farm."},
[8529]={"Mensaje para Taylor Green","Earur desea ayudar a la gente de Archet y cree que hay suficientes suministros para comenzar la reconstrucción. Para asegurarse de que los suministros no se agoten demasiado rápido, te indicó que visites a Taylor Green en el aserradero de Combe.","'Las penas de Archet no pasaron desapercibidas aquí en Combe, y es bueno lo que Earur está haciendo, sin duda. Pero el mal de los Montebruno se ha extendido y ahora está en el mismo bosque donde necesitamos recoger la madera para Archet.\
\
'Haré lo que pueda, pero como puedes ver, también tenemos nuestros propios problemas.'","'Los suministros aquí en Archet son limitados y ciertamente no bastarán para reparar los daños causados al pueblo. Ahora que tengo mis herramientas, podré empezar a reforzar las vallas y reparar los edificios donde pueda.\
\
'Archet necesitará más madera para recuperarse completamente de este ataque. Si vas a Combe, al sur, busca a Taylor Green y dile que necesitaré otro pedido de madera del aserradero.\
\
'Si nunca has estado allí, escucha bien. El aserradero de Combe se encuentra siguiendo el camino hacia el sur. Cruza la puerta hacia Combe y sigue el camino al este subiendo la colina. Luego se curva suavemente hacia el noreste, hacia el bosque de Chet. Allí, en una pequeña hondonada antes del norte del bosque de Chet, deberías encontrar a Taylor Green.'","'Apresúrate ahora. Haré lo que pueda, pero la madera no durará mucho. Busca a Taylor Green en el aserradero al este y norte del centro de Combe.'","Dile a Taylor Green en el aserradero de Combe que el constructor Earur necesita más madera en Archet.\
\
Earur mencionó que Archet necesitaría más madera para reconstruirse por completo. Te pidió que visites el aserradero de Combe y le digas a Taylor Green que Archet necesita más madera."},
[8530]={"Listein se encuentra en la Puerta de las Nubes, la entrada a Zirakzigil en el Camino de Durin.\
\
Líkmund te ha pedido que lleves un mensaje a Listein que podría contener información sobre la ubicación de un artefacto perdido en Moria.","'¿Un mensaje? No esperaba ningún mensaje, ¿de qué se trata?'\
\
Entregas el mensaje, y Listein lo revisa.\
\
'¡Este artefacto no estaba nada lejos de aquí! Es una noticia maravillosa, ${PLAYER}. ¡Con esta información, podré preservar otro artefacto que se creía perdido!'","Habla con Listein en la entrada de Zirakzigil","Líkmund te ha dado un mensaje para llevar a Listein en la Puerta de las Nubes, la entrada a Zirakzigil en el Camino de Durin.","'La Puerta de las Nubes se encuentra al norte y un poco al este. Es un pequeño puesto avanzado al inicio del gélido Zirakzigil.'","Mensaje para Zirakzigil","'El Camino de Durin alberga pocos de los artefactos de nuestros ancestros, muchos de los cuales han sido perdidos o destruidos por los trasgos.\
\
'Listein ha estado buscando estos artefactos por todo el Camino de Durin, con la esperanza de preservar la historia de nuestro oficio. Llévale este mensaje. Revela la última ubicación conocida de uno de esos artefactos, y estoy seguro de que le agradecerá esta información.'"},
[8532]={"'I do not feel good, but I am still happy that you saved my tad!'","Talk to Vevinn in Barnavon","'Matho was not much use as my daughter's husband anyway.'","'Yago was a good husband... I wish you could have saved him.'","Talk to Tafin in Barnavon","Talk to Rhonwen in Barnavon","Talk to Nesta in Barnavon","'Thank you for bringing my Wilim to safety!'","'Mam is very sad because Tad is never coming home.'","'Tad was hurt, but I am glad he is alive!'","'Matho will never return to us....'","Gwilum is outside the gate to Barnavon-town.\
\
You should return to Gwilum and let him know that you have done as he requested.","'Siam was hurt, but lives still? Then we shall be thankful that worse did not come upon him. We shall prepare for his joyous return!'","'Inir will heal well, thanks to you, ${PLAYER}.'","'Thank you for saving my tad!'","Talk to Gwilum in Barnavon","'Thank you for returning Siam to me... he is resting now.'","'Inir will be a welcome sight... praise be to the Turch-gwirod for his safe return!'","'Mam says Tad is dead... why couldn't you save him?'","You brought news of the fates of the missing miners at the Barnavon Mine to Gwilum, as Cada had requested.","'You are the duvodiad who saved my tad!'","Messenger of Fate","'I will make you a warm hood to thank you for saving my tad!'","'Wilim lives! What joyous news! May the blessings of the Turch-gwirod be ever with you!'","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. You have proven a true friend to the Boar-clan once again.\
\
'There is little that I can do personally for the families of Yago and Matho, for if the Brenin learns of it, my life would be at greater risk than it is... but perhaps together we may find a way to aid them.'","'Yago is dead? N-no... this cannot be true! How dare you say such things, Duvodiad?\
\
'Ah, but nay, I see in your eyes that it is true... thank Gwilum for his concern and thoughtfulness.'","'Tad is not coming back ever?'","'Stupid duvodiad... now my tad is dead!'","Talk to Usbail in Barnavon","'This cannot be! Matho has perished in that accursed mine? What shall we do now? The Ox-clan pigs will starve my children to death!\
\
'Perhaps Gwilum will know what to do?'","Usbail, Vevinn, Tafin, Rhonwen, and Nesta may be found at their homes within Lower Barnavon, far to the west of the Barnavon Mine.\
\
Gwilum has asked you to take news of the once-missing miners to their families.","'${PLAYER}, you did a great service for the Turch-lûth, the Boar-clan, by finding the missing miners. Will you now go to the families of the miners and relay to them the news of their husbands' and fathers' fates?\
\
'We will help the families of those who perished as best we can, but perhaps Gwilum will be better able to help them.\
\
'Return to Barnavon and speak with Usbail, Vevinn, Tafin, Rhonwen, and Nesta.'"},
[8533]={"Deliver letter to Concerned Husband","Bâdarul has requested that you assist in delivering letters explaining their loss to the families of soldiers who have fallen in battle here in Iridír.","Messenger of Grief","Return to Bâdarul in Iridír and let him know that you have given the letters to the grieving families.","'I am glad to see you. We have suffered losses here in Iridír from the assault led by Bârshud II and now the families must be informed.\
\
'These letters contain the news as well as personal sentiments for the ones affected. I know it will not be enough but we have to at least be sure they know what happened to their loved ones.\
\
'Would you assist me in delivering them? I do not feel I can take them myself as I need to grieve for the loss as they were all beloved friends and I can not face their families yet.'","'I trust you have delivered the terrible news to the families. I hope that they are able to find peace.\
\
'Thank you for your help, ${PLAYER}. I will not forget this act of kindness.'","Deliver letter to Concerned Wife","Return to Bâdarul in Iridír"},
[8534]={"A messenger of the White Hand can be found among the perimeter forces outside of Brockbridge or on the road beyond it.\
\
Herefara has asked you to intercept one of the White Hand messengers and learn what you may about their support.","The messenger appears to be holding a crude map","Find a messenger","The Brockbridge siege seems to be supported by a larger White Hand army, and there have been messengers spotted coming and going from the front lines.","Messenger of the Brockbridge Siege","'${PLAYER}, I have a task for you.\
\
'The enemy has a perimeter outside the town, and neither of our forces seems to make much progress against the other. I know there are many more of the White Hand out there supporting this siege. If they bolster the perimeter, we could be caught unprepared.\
\
'What I need is more information about those supporting this siege and if more reinforcements are coming. I have seen messengers among their troops, who very likely have the information I seek. Intercept one and learn what you may from him.'","Return the map to Herefara in Brockbridge.","'This is an interesting but crudely drawn map. These Orcs are using some kind of symbolism to represent the area's features and our defences. I will need to study this to determine what it all means.\
\
'One distinguishable marking on here represents a very large force of White Hand nearby. That must be the support behind this endless siege, and perhaps my fears are coming true; that an unstoppable force is bearing down upon us.'","You hand the crude map over to Herefara","Bring the map to Herefara"},
[8535]={"'Ah! This is wonderful, ${PLAYER}. I have never seen such advanced, finely-crafted tools. These will work better than the rusty and broken things the people have been trying to use up 'til now.'","Forged a multi-purpose toolkit (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hildelith has given you a recipe for a multi-purpose toolkit.\
\
You should forge a multi-purpose toolkit for the refugees who hope to start rebuilding Wildermore.","A skilled metalsmith such as yourself can help the refugees of Wildermore by forging a multi-purpose toolkit for them.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Wildermore's Recovery will cancel this quest.</rgb>","Metalsmith: Multi-purpose Toolkit","Hildelith is in Forlaw.\
\
You have crafted a multi-purpose toolkit, and should now deliver it to Hildelith.","Forge a multi-purpose toolkit for the people of Wildermore (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Deliver the multi-purpose toolkit to Hildelith","'I hear that you are gifted at working with metals, ${PLAYER}. Would you be willing to forge something for the refugees of Wildermore?\
\
'A set of tools would surely help the builders to repair the damage that has been done. Is this something you can make?'"},
[8536]={"Defeated Shadow-wolves (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'These strange black wolves stalk Fordirith, particularly at night as the shadows grow long and the sun is hidden from view.\
\
'These fell spirits hunt us with dark purpose, ${PLAYER}, and if our company is to pass safely, we must slay as many as we can and drive them back to their lairs.\
\
'Go forth, my friend, and aid us with your prowess. Drive back this shadow, so that we may fulfill our purpose in the South.'","Defeat Shadow-wolves (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'These fell spirits are relentless, ${PLAYER}. Despite your efforts, these creatures reappear in full number.\
\
'Ah well, I must thank you for your efforts nonetheless.'","Shadow-wolves stalk the lands of Fordirith, hunting the members of the Grey Company with deadly intent.","Midnight Hunters","'Deal with the Shadow-wolves, ${PLAYER}...they are a great threat to our quest.'","Talk to Amarion at Echad Dagoras","At night, Shadow-wolves can be found throughout the region, but during the light of day they seem to lair in and around the Black Dens only.\
\
Amarion has asked you to defeat several of the Shadow-wolves that stalk Fordirith.","Amarion is at Echad Dagoras, north-west of the Black Dens.\
\
You should bring news of your success to Amarion."},
[8537]={"Incursión de medianoche","¡Vuestro ataque contra el campamento de dunlendino ha fracasado!","Lleva una adamantita imbuida a Perimbant","'Ah, ojalá hubiera podido estar allí para verlo. Aunque el fuego es un arma torpe, ilumina alegremente una velada con espada y arco, ¿no es así?\
\
'Con los dunlendinos derrotados y su campamento en ruinas, no deberíamos tener mucho de qué preocuparnos por ese lado durante un tiempo.\
\
'Bien, veamos cómo imbuir las cualidades que buscas, ¿de acuerdo?'","Sin que los dunlendinos de Eregion lo sepan, su campamento más grande se ha construido sobre una antigua forja élfica donde se forjaron algunas de las mejores armas del principio de la Tercera Edad. Si se quiere utilizar esta forja, los dunlendinos deben ser obligados a retirarse.","'¿Así que tú y tus compañeros lograsteis expulsar a los dunlendinos de su campamento? ¡Bien hecho! ¡Un obstáculo menos que superar antes de que termine esta guerra!'","Perimbant se encuentra en Echad Eregion, al oeste de las puertas de Moria.\
\
Debes volver con Perimbant para completar la mejora de tu arma.","'Tendrás que traerme una adamantita imbuida para que podamos comenzar.'","'Solo queda una forja en Eregion donde se puede obtener la calidad que deseas. Tras los primeros años de la Tercera Edad, la antigua herrería cayó en ruinas, y hoy en día los dunlendinos han construido un gran campamento fortificado sobre ellas. Por suerte, desconocen la importancia de las ruinas, pero su presencia complica las cosas.\
\
'Creo que es hora de hacer algo con ese campamento, y aunque no tenemos las fuerzas para un asalto directo, tengo en mente un plan más astuto, aunque poco sutil.\
\
'Debes reunir a un pequeño grupo de compañeros y preparar una incursión nocturna al campamento. Si tienes éxito, entonces podrás utilizar la forja.'","Perimbant se encuentra en Echad Dúnann, al oeste de las puertas de Moria.\
\
Perimbant te ha pedido que hables con él cuando quieras partir hacia el campamento de los dunlendinos, donde llevarás a cabo una incursión nocturna contra los soldados acampados allí.","Lleva la adamantita potenciada a Perimbant","Perimbant te ha pedido que le traigas una adamantita imbuida para dotar a tu arma del poder que deseas. Sin embargo, desconoce dónde podrías encontrar dicha piedra.","'¡Ah! Has conseguido una adamantita imbuida. Ahora tendrás que llevarlo al campamento de los dunlendinos.\
\
'Avísame cuando tú y tus compañeros estéis listos para partir, y os contaré el plan que he ideado.'","Habla con Perimbant para viajar al campamento de los dunlendinos.","'¿No pudiste imbuir la piedra? Sin ella no puedo ayudarte.'","'Si tú y tus compañeros estáis preparados, podéis partir. He preparado una pequeña barca para que la llevéis río arriba hasta el lado este del campamento, donde mis exploradores dicen que los defensores están menos atentos. Una vez que desembarquéis, debéis eliminar rápidamente a tantos guardias veteranos como sea posible, ya que representan la mayor amenaza de arruinar el plan dando la alarma.\
\
'Una vez eliminada la amenaza de los guardias, dirigíos al centro del campamento donde encontraréis una gran hoguera que los dunlendinos mantienen bien encendida día y noche. Una vez que lleguéis a ella, debéis encargar a alguien que prenda fuego a tantas tiendas de campaña como sea posible alrededor de la hoguera, sembrando el caos por todo el campamento.\
\
'Si podéis prender fuego a suficiente campamento, los soldados restantes deberían abandonarlo por miedo, dándoos el tiempo que necesitáis para hacer vuestro trabajo en la forja.'"},
[8538]={"'Debo admitir que no tengo ni idea de qué significan esas marcas extrañas. Pero hay un joven Lossoth, una especie de aprendiz de vidente —los llaman näkijä— que quizá sepa algo al respecto.\
\
'Mika se ha embarcado en algún tipo de misión en ese cementerio de mamuts, Norsu-hauta, justo al sur de aquí.\
\
'¿Podrías ir allí y preguntarle por esas marcas?'","Mika podría saberlo","'¡Ve a hablar con el muchacho lossoth! No soy de gran ayuda si lo que te interesa son las marcas de ese colmillo. Ahora bien, si quieres aprender sobre cómo fabricar lanzas, entonces soy tu enano…'","Mika se encuentra en Norsu-hauta, al sur de Zigilgund.\
\
Sigrík te ha pedido que hables con el joven näkijä Mika acerca de las marcas del colmillo de mamut que recogiste para él.","Sigrík te ha permitido llevarte prestado el colmillo que encontraste para él, cubierto de marcas misteriosas. Te sugirió que un aprendiz de näkijä lossoth llamado Mika, que vive en Norsu-hauta, podría saber qué significan.","Habla con Mika","'¿Qué me traes? Déjame ver… ¿dónde encontraste este colmillo?'"},
[8540]={"Se busca: Orejas recortadas de la región de Anórien Ancestral.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger orejas recortadas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: Orejas recortadas de la región de Anórien Ancestral. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Anórien Ancestral.","Entrega las orejas recortadas en una caja de recolección","Orejas recortadas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Recoge orejas recortadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir orejas recortadas.","Tarea de Minas Tirith: Orejas recortadas"},
[8541]={"Tarea de Minas Tirith: Garras dañadas","Recoge garras dañadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entrega las garras dañadas en una caja de recolección","Se busca: Garras dañadas de la región de Anórien Ancestral. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Anórien Ancestral.","Se busca: Garras dañadas de la región de Anórien Ancestral.","Garras dañadas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir garras dañadas.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger garras dañadas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."},
[8542]={"Se busca: Vainas de espada picadas de la región de Anórien Ancestral. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Anórien Ancestral.","Tarea de Minas Tirith: Vainas de espada picadas","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir vainas de espada picadas.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger vainas de espada picadas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega las vainas de espada picadas en una caja de recolección","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Recoge vainas de espada picadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Vainas de espada picadas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Vainas de espada picadas de la región de Anórien Ancestral."},
[8543]={"Se busca: Caparazones brillantes de la región de Anórien Ancestral. Recógelos para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Anórien Ancestral.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir caparazones brillantes.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger caparazones brillantes. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Entrega los caparazones brillantes en una caja de recolección","Tarea de Minas Tirith: Caparazones brillantes","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Recoge caparazones brillantes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Caparazones brillantes recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Caparazones brillantes de la región de Anórien Ancestral."},
[8544]={"Entrega la masa espesa en una caja de recolección","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir masa espesada.","Se busca: Masa espesada de la región de Anórien Ancestral.","Recoge masa espesa (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de Minas Tirith: Masa espesada","Masa espesa recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger masa espesada. Se puede entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: Masa espesada de la región de Anórien Ancestral. Recógela para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Anórien Ancestral."},
[8545]={"Tarea de Minas Tirith: Pieles rasgadas","Entrega las pieles rasgadas en una caja de recolección","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir pieles rasgadas.","Recoge pieles rasgadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Pieles rasgadas de la región de Anórien Ancestral.","Alguien ha publicado una tarea para recoger pieles rasgadas. Se pueden entregar a cambio de una recompensa.","Se busca: Pieles rasgadas de la región de Anórien Ancestral. Recógelas para ganar una recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista en Anórien Ancestral.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Pieles rasgadas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[8546]={"Find the mine at the Arch of Adazâr","'Hah! Of course Lâkindar still stands proud! Nothing is as strong as dwarf stone-craft! If this Erakúndo is called the Spent-lodes, exploration there may be a waste of time, though we dwarves may yet find seams missed by the Men who named it so.\
\
'The Ordâkhai mine is an open pit to this day? Zigêt! I hope that one day we are able to oust those worthless wretches. Or better yet, someone else does it for us! This Arch of Adazâr is intriguing. From your description, it sounds like it is the work of Shagâni Men, before the coming of Ordâkh.\
\
'Well, ${PLAYER}, you have given me much to think about! Thank you for sating my curiosity.'","This is an open pit-mine still in use by the Ordâkhai","Men have mined in An Shêru for hundreds of years, but the Din of Stone was powerful and likely collapsed the mines not of dwarf-design.","Find the mine at Lâkindar","Adazâr is sealed shut and overrun with kergrim","Lâkindar is in good condition but is haunted by shades and wights","'Well met, traveller. I have a question, and I was wondering if you could help me find the answer. Historically, we have had many problems with Men coming to An Shêru to pillage its once rich resources. The result is the landscape you see around you today.\
\
'In an earlier age, we went to war with Men who wanted the greatest treasure of all, Jiret-menêsh. This war ended with an agreement that Men were allowed to mine in other parts of An Shêru, but there were provisions that they cause no harm to the land and do not mar its beauty. Their king swore an Oath to this, and for many generations of Men, the Oath was kept.\
\
'When these Ordâkhai arrived from the south, they did not know of this oath, though it was made on behalf of all Men. But I do not think they would have cared, even if they had known about it. They cut down and hauled off all of the trees to fuel their war machine. They dug pit-mines... horrible things, those.\
\
'Their final blow was the Din of Stone, causing massive unnatural earthquakes that surely collapsed many mines and stopped the flow of the Usâl River. It was then that Châmelek Gêta had had enough of Men and sealed the doors of Jiret-menêsh shut to the outside world.\
\
'I cannot help but wonder, though, did all of the other mines collapse? Could any of them be reopened? In what state will we find the pit-mines? Since you are unafraid to traverse this land, would you be willing to visit these locations and tell me how they fare? I am most curious about Erakúndo, Gebarakór, Adazâr, and Lâkindar.'","This mine is called 'The Spent-lodes' and is possibly collapsed","Find the mine at Erakúndo","Talk to Kufâro in Jiret-menêsh","Find the mine at Gebarakór","Kufâro has asked you to visit the locations of other mines in An Shêru and assess their condition. Erakúndo and Gebarakór are near each other in southern An Shêru. Adazâr is in the far western part of the region, and Lâkindar is in the south-west corner.","You have visited the locations of other mines in An Shêru and assessed their condition. You should return to Kufâro in Jiret-menêsh.","Mine Inspections"},
[8547]={"Los enanos de la expedición minera han solicitado una colección de garras de púas.","Garras de púas recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de los mineros: Garras de púas","Recolecta garras de púas y déjalas en una caja de recolección (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Esta caja de recolección es revisada diariamente por los enanos. Tu colección seguramente llegará a la parte solicitante.","Se busca: Garras de púas","Se busca: Garras de púas\
\
Los enanos de la expedición minera han solicitado una colección de garras de púas.","Las cajas de recolección para esta tarea se pueden encontrar en los principales centros de Moria.\
\
Debes llevar los trofeos que reuniste a una caja de recolección."},
[8548]={"Se busca: Hermosas vainas de espada","Los enanos de la expedición minera han solicitado una colección de hermosas vainas de espada.","Esta caja de recolección es revisada diariamente por los enanos. Tu colección seguramente llegará a la parte solicitante.","Recolecta hermosas vainas de espada y déjalas en una caja de recolección (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Hermosas vainas de espada\
\
Los enanos de la expedición minera han solicitado una colección de hermosas vainas de espada.","Las cajas de recolección para esta tarea se pueden encontrar en los principales centros de Moria.\
\
Debes llevar los trofeos que reuniste a una caja de recolección.","Hermosas vainas de espada recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de mineros: Hermosas vainas de espada"},
